include _mixins.jade

doctype html

html
    head
        +defaultmeta()
        title Aw_Man3703 ; Projects
        +defaultcss("projects")
    body
        h1 Projects!
        div.spacer
        section#projectList
            article.project
                span.title YouTube Background player
                a(href="https://ybp.im-bo.red") Website
                a(href="https://github.com/AwMan3703/youtube-bg-player") Github
                p.description
                    | I got tired of YouTube pausing my videos when I turned off my phone's screen.
                    | This tool allows me to play videos with my screen off.
                    | Also allows linking playlists and saving them to LocalStorage for quick access.
            article.project
                span.title C boilerplate generator
                a(href="https://awman3703.github.io/c-boilerplate-generator/") Website
                a(href="https://github.com/AwMan3703/c-boilerplate-generator") Github
                p.description
                    | Small tool to generate boilerplate C code and compilation commands.
                    | Also has settings profiles.
            article.project
                span.title Cheatsheet generator
                a(href="https://awman3703.github.io/art-cheatsheet-maker/") Website
                a(href="https://github.com/AwMan3703/art-cheatsheet-maker") Github
                p.description
                    | Web-based tool to create cheatsheets as I'm taking notes during class, and exports them to PNG.
                    | Also allows multiple profiles via JSON config, corresponding to the different subjects I'm taking notes on.
            article.project
                span.title Vinder
                a(href="https://github.com/AwMan3703/vinder") Github
                p.description
                    | Logs into Vinted (second-hand clothes & electronics) with my credentials and creates a Tinder-style feed.
                    | I can "like" products in this feed to add them to my account's favorites, or make the lowest allowed offer to the seller, directly from the UI.
            article.project
                span.title Pocket Folder
                a(href="https://github.com/AwMan3703/pocket-folder") Github
                p.description
                    | macOS application that sits in the menu bar, and allows quick access (and drag/drop) to selected folders.
        div.spacer
        p.text-secondary More coming soon...
        +defaultjs("projects")